+- [x] AI caret with flag and Instruction while a Refine or a Review pass runs ("Reviewing" during a Review pass; an Ask request shows in the requests tray instead, with no fill over its text; the flag flips left at the right edge; the bar breathes and the three dots pulse as in Electron, 4 px apart instead of 2 to stay on the 4 px grid; the caret takes off from the writer's caret and glides to each new place in 560 ms as in Electron, its height changes at once, and it leaves without the fade; while the view scrolls or the lines reflow it stays on the text instead of gliding after it)
